dmmeta.printfmt  printfmt:Auto  comment:"Neutral value: the strfmt's own shape; under strfmt:String that is Tuple"
dmmeta.printfmt  printfmt:Bitset  comment:"Comma-separated list of names of set bits"
dmmeta.printfmt  printfmt:CompactSep  comment:"Separator, omit default values. Declared only: amc generates no printer and no reader"
dmmeta.printfmt  printfmt:Extern  comment:"User-provided function"
dmmeta.printfmt  printfmt:Raw  comment:"Print all fields one after another"
dmmeta.printfmt  printfmt:Sep  comment:Separator
dmmeta.printfmt  printfmt:Tuple  comment:"Ssim tuple"
